#: kptview.cpp:489
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<note>This action cannot be undone.</note><nl/><nl/>Create a new Project "
"from the current project with new project- and task identities.<nl/"
">Resource- and calendar identities are not changed.<nl/>All scheduling "
